5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is so lovely that we are doing this together. I wonder if we should look into how our seating affects our conversations?,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,We should be objective. I am interested in the staff survey and the badge records to see how things actually are.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think the budget is important. Maybe the floor billing and the facilities quote?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,I want to know about the morning routine upstairs! And maybe those unplanned shuffles from last year?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'll handle the physical side. Sound meter readings and the physio's note seem like the only rational choices for comfort.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Toshio, that sounds very fair. I will look into the project strands and what the new joiners reported.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
