55,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"Option B, Fixed Desks by Function, seems to allow us to group people who need to talk, which is lovely.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Option B is the only one that prevents the early-bird advantage of Option A and the instability of Option C.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,I vote for B. It's the most budget-friendly in the long run since we won't be re-running cables.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Mio,,I can't do Option A; the morning setup is too much. I'll go with B too!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Option B is the only choice that preserves ergonomic settings and manages the noise levels effectively.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Shizue,,Is everyone in agreement then? It seems we have found a peaceful solution.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Toshio,,It is the most rational choice given the data we gathered.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,I feel much better knowing we aren't just guessing with the money.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Mio,,Yay! No more packing boxes every few months!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,I'll ensure the noise-sensitive spots are assigned to those who need them.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
